"""
WorkBuddy Multi-Account Manager & Automation Toolkit (workbuddy CLI)
https://github.com/FlapPearLabs/workbuddy-toolkit

Features:
- Zero-Scan Account Switcher: Log in once, save the profile, and NEVER scan QR code again when switching.
- Cross-Platform Support: Full support for macOS, Linux, and Windows.
- Shared Workspace & Session Sync: Universal workspace trees and chat histories across all accounts.
- Automated Daily Check-in: Headless status probe and credit claims via Tencent backend endpoints.
- Automated Daily Dialogue: Auto-fires minimal prompt to maintain continuous dialogue rewards with lowest multiplier / free models.
- Direct CLI Chat: Talk directly with WorkBuddy models in terminal without Electron UI overhead.
- Auto Profile Discovery: Automatically detects and registers newly logged-in accounts.
"""

